{"product_id":"the-sandman-and-the-turtles","title":"The Sandman and the Turtles","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Sandman and the Turtles is one of the most charming summer reads for children from Britain's best-loved children's author, Michael Morpurgo. Michael loves summer holidays in Wales, and Dadci's tall stories about the Sandman, the old Russian sea captain and blood-red dragon in his lair. Little cousin Polly believes every word of the magical tales and she's determined to make it all come true. Former Children's Laureate and award-winning author of War Horse, Michael Morpurgo, again demonstrates why he is considered to be the master story teller with this much-loved magical tale about two children holidaying on the Welsh coast.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 198 x 129\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michael Morpurgo\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781405226677\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45834338893977,"sku":"17RD-39781405226677","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ff7718a5fa0_The_Sandman_and_the_Turtles_Michael_Morpurgo.jpg?v=1761588365","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-sandman-and-the-turtles","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}